{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上8時10分，天文台錄得氣溫26.3°C，相對濕度78%。</p><p>本港地區今日（11月1日）天氣預測：大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約29°C。</p><p>吹和緩偏東風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望明日（11月2日）部分時間有陽光。</p><p>隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:05.787648+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T00:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:58:19.124386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064602+00:00","content_hash":"b8d2d509e50ad1b2693988638b9610fbf8617fd5c77d36534efa0d2ff9cb3440","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}